      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it just feels like there's a lot of hidden stuff in there that isn't obvious. are there specific words or phrases that usually signal a \"trap\" or something that might bite me later? like what kind of language should i be scanning for?",
      "source": "evaluator"
